<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch - April 25.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch - April 25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Xilinx Inc's stock price fell in after-hours trading to 49-1/4 from a close of 51-1/4 on the Nasdaq after the company reported lower fiscal fourth quarter earnings.</p>
<p>* International Business Machines Corp, which soared 11-3/8 in New York Thursday after impressive first quarter profits, was down 1/2 at 153-1/4 in London.</p>
<p>Intel Corp was down 3/8 at 145-3/4 in London.  </p>
<p>* Ford Motor Co added 1/8 to 34-5/8 in London after news that its Hertz rental car business, which is due to make its debut on the New York Stock Exchange today, will price at the top of market expectations.</p>
